      "role": "user",
      "content": "the water didnt really do much and it still feels like something is stuck in there. the chamomile drops have worked for my allergies before and they're much gentler than tap water. wouldn't it be better to just use those to settle the sting instead of going to a doctor for just a little splash?? i dont want to sit in an ER waiting room all night if it's just a minor burn.",
